(7698748, 1263245, 103142, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue! I obviously was wrong. :)</td>', 'Congrats on the blue! I obviously was wrong. :)', '2021-08-09 11:08:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7698749, 1263175, 103142, '<td valign="top">I agree that adding the room to the left was a good choice. The right part of the photo was nice enough, but the fact that the left was so different, different warmth, particularly, draws your eye to it and does intensify the feeling of emptiness. If you were going for pretty -- just the right part. But when you''re going for the ghost town/empty feeling, it adds quite a bit to the story.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'I agree that adding the room to the left was a good choice. The right part of the photo was nice enough, but the fact that the left was so different, different warmth, particularly, draws your eye to it and does intensify the feeling of emptiness. If you were going for pretty -- just the right part. But when you''re going for the ghost town/empty feeling, it adds quite a bit to the story. Congrats on the ribbon!', '2021-08-09 11:11:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7698751, 1263227, 103142, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t sure about the sky being so large, but the more I looked, the more it worked. 7 from me.  Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'I wasn''t sure about the sky being so large, but the more I looked, the more it worked. 7 from me.  Congrats on the HM!', '2021-08-09 11:12:19.000000', NULL, 0),
